      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON FIXER (3) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 2 lengths at Geelong in a handy 26.04. Has a low draw and goes well over this trip. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Can continue on his winning ways. IMITATED (8) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 6 length 6th at this track (25.62). Comes through a solid form race last start. Shapes as one to consider. BEELINE (1) missed the frame latest when seventh at Healesville (19.71) but scored four back at Sale (24.27). Bold showing expected. DAVE (7) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
